      "en": "You have multiplied your slain in this city, and you have filled its streets with the slain.”",
      "ko": "너희가 이 성읍에서 많이 살륙하여 그 시체로 거리에 채웠도다",
      "source_text_hash": "9784e55f839f8c2470845c3653b18cb5a9c5c9be2ba3e425dd9ef384c1ca1e2b",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2b9a83aeb18a15aae507c37b9a2fada140c79820d981fd4017f992e814f12ff",
