      "en": "“I will bring you out of the middle of it, and deliver you into the hands of strangers, and will execute judgments among you.",
      "ko": "너희를 그 성읍 가운데서 끌어내어 타국인의 손에 붙여 너희에게 벌을 내리리니",
      "source_text_hash": "44776a37c2fb49a44b34c9f917e9b47cc9f830c1fe1ec61fb430987a1ab56fa6",
      "translation_text_hash": "33c40385f7b669bc737f9b14df1c277f39075f1d72c411affca115267b7554b7",
